{"chapter": "artin", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "07XD", "placeholders": {"STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:403d1f17256e853c0d20477aa3f61a1f8b11de5f02cc9f46d02d67aa21818ced", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nHere is a sanity check.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:13603f7059b00889589513a41395e57f0b6aa3d3776fe8aa6e4aa6101b3b0f15", "unit_id": "tag:07XD:prose-0004"}
{"chapter": "artin", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "07XD", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$S$", "MATH_0002": "$f : U \\to V$", "MATH_0003": "$S$", "MATH_0004": "$u_0 \\in U$", "MATH_0005": "$f$", "MATH_0006": "$u_0$", "MATH_0007": "$f$", "MATH_0008": "$(\\Sch/V)_{fppf}$", "MATH_0009": "$U$", "MATH_0010": "$u_0$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-versal-implies-smooth}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:15ffad1c35147f353d0b9d2acb2c8d38f45471c80ab98e19d48ccaa58a301532", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:4317e3e6a6bd17428fa56cc04a0e91b14006e5d6ccbeacf7ba8bfce2afe1b253", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a locally Noetherian scheme. Let <MATH_0002>\nbe a morphism of schemes locally of finite type over <MATH_0003>.\nLet <MATH_0004> be a finite type point. The following are equivalent\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0005> is smooth at <MATH_0006>,\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0007> viewed as an object of <MATH_0008> over <MATH_0009> is\nversal at <MATH_0010>.\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:701a71b2b1b65121d6226e528c4d857a64732245832eca3793d88ba4ef064283", "unit_id": "tag:0CXL:statement"}
{"chapter": "artin", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "07XD", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{more-morphisms-lemma-lifting-along-artinian-at-point}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:e43a42d1bc55bd1e76e645b327db997c567aacf9b6eafe0d3f0407ebbc5d33f8", "source_text": "This is a restatement of More on Morphisms, Lemma\n<REF_0001>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:3ba009241935bd443262bed8811a70b80817bc6b707d35e39ee2a3b9c07b60de", "unit_id": "tag:0CXL:proof"}
{"chapter": "artin", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "07XD", "placeholders": {"STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:403d1f17256e853c0d20477aa3f61a1f8b11de5f02cc9f46d02d67aa21818ced", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nIt turns out that this notion is well behaved with respect to field\nextensions.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:af77e9b23d88ad63b1b2d49e2f41ebdd08d59d98c29b4de867c1c4adf5ade19b", "unit_id": "tag:07XD:prose-0005"}
{"chapter": "artin", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "07XD", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$S$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0003": "$U$", "MATH_0004": "$x$", "MATH_0005": "$u_0$", "MATH_0006": "$l$", "MATH_0007": "$u_{l, 0} : \\Spec(l) \\to U$", "MATH_0008": "$u_0$", "MATH_0009": "$l/k = \\kappa(u_0)$", "MATH_0010": "$x_{l, 0} = x_0|_{\\Spec(l)}$", "MATH_0011": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0012": "$x$", "MATH_0013": "$u_0$", "MATH_0014": "$$\n\\mathcal{F}_{(\\Sch/U)_{fppf}, l, u_{l, 0}}\n\\longrightarrow\n\\mathcal{F}_{\\mathcal{X}, l, x_{l, 0}}\n$$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{definition-versal}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-versal-change-of-field}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:a1db318d1e1b84397affe8cd8f5d0f294422e6c3b275731448a2d573d48d2cdc", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:62abd14831fea514eb4bbf67e39a6661727f144c2275e3bad13161e978c27d5e", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001>, <MATH_0002>, <MATH_0003>, <MATH_0004>, <MATH_0005> be as in\nDefinition <REF_0001>. Let <MATH_0006> be a field and let\n<MATH_0007> be a morphism with image <MATH_0008> such that\n<MATH_0009> is finite. Set <MATH_0010>.\nIf <MATH_0011> satisfies (RS) and <MATH_0012> is versal at <MATH_0013>, then\n<MATH_0014>\nis smooth.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:a5d6ff548f31c85b465c93f4786c4fe6cf9ecb8a13c4629751d70ba087999b87", "unit_id": "tag:07XG:statement"}
{"chapter": "artin", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "07XD", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$(\\Sch/U)_{fppf}$", "MATH_0002": "$$\n(\\mathcal{F}_{(\\Sch/U)_{fppf}, k , u_0})_{l/k}\n\\longrightarrow\n(\\mathcal{F}_{\\mathcal{X}, k , x_0})_{l/k}\n$$", "MATH_0003": "$\\hat x$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-algebraic-stack-RS}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-change-of-field}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{formal-defos-lemma-change-of-fields-smooth}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:f7cb202d3704345f7b52c38752857c4221f8d9745e56118e62f5d62fb79ed255", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:a36c7a527bb1bdfbf30952de77040e4945ef63b01ca685e205df9d5f773dafe7", "source_text": "Note that <MATH_0001> satisfies (RS) by\nLemma <REF_0001>.\nHence the functor of the lemma is the functor\n<MATH_0002>\nassociated to <MATH_0003>, see Lemma <REF_0002>.\nHence the lemma follows from\nFormal Deformation Theory, Lemma\n<REF_0003>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:d6028c7036476a4499fcc8e6fb2271ed92c79649345781ced26cbb6283a7318d", "unit_id": "tag:07XG:proof"}
{"chapter": "artin", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "07XD", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$x$", "MATH_0002": "$u_0$", "MATH_0003": "$x$", "MATH_0004": "$U$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{X}$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{definition-versal}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:7dd1ae8fc18ebd0afd8968fae6fc3c3770615b6a04949af31cfd622466b13548", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:10e1c7ca2148135217224861fb50d87de21de0c2d9feaa6abfb05e8b68842f15", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nThe following lemma is another sanity check. It more or less\nsignifies that if <MATH_0001> is versal at <MATH_0002> as in\nDefinition <REF_0001>,\nthen <MATH_0003> viewed as a morphism from <MATH_0004> to <MATH_0005> is\nsmooth whenever we make a base change by a scheme.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:2203e77a1b7211bf39375a3700717ad09c266422d158468f9d015c375b865037", "unit_id": "tag:07XD:prose-0006"}
